WHAT WAS BUILT (20 swift files — a complete decomposed page bundle, the established P4 convention)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  AlertStudioPage.swift              top-level adaptive View (scaffold, phase switch, two-column
                                     macOS/iPad split vs iPhone stack, toolbar actions, snooze sheet
                                     host, discard dialog); surfaceSlug + /notifications/studio route.
  AlertStudioPage.Model.swift        P1/S10 i18n facade, P1/S11 telemetry seam, connectivity axis,
                                     mutation payloads, the input snapshot, the page/rules/channels
                                     phases, and the P1/S8 AlertStudioSource protocol.
  AlertStudioPage.Store.swift        @Observable @MainActor AlertStudioModel — bound snapshot +
                                     editor/selection/bulk/search/snooze state + derived phases.
  AlertStudioPage.Intents.swift      the web handlers: guarded selection, the seven mutations, bulk,
                                     snooze, dirty-guard, localization helpers (extension on the model).
  AlertStudioPage.InMemorySource.swift  in-memory source applying the 7 mutations locally (previews/tests).
  AlertStudioPage.Projection.swift   pure domain enums (severity/op/kind/trigger/value-kind/signal-type).
  AlertStudioPage.Domain.swift       pure domain rows + the editor draft (Rule/Channel/Vehicle/Metric/
                                     SignalDefinition/RuleTemplate/EditorState).
  AlertStudioPage.Catalog.swift      pure signal-catalog + value-kind/operator/save-validity engine +
                                     the ruleToEditor / templateToEditor hydration (unit tested).
  AlertStudioPage.Templates.swift    the 47 curated rule templates, ported verbatim from the web array.
  AlertStudioPage.States.swift       glass card (.regularMaterial), severity tints, freshness chip +
                                     connectivity banner, page loading/error, shimmer, date format.
  AlertStudioPage.Views.swift        Templates panel + template card (web panels 2 & 3), search field,
                                     flow layout.
  AlertStudioPage.RulesViews.swift   Rules list panel + rule row (web panels 4 & 5), bulk toolbar,
                                     channels panel (web panel 8).
  AlertStudioPage.Editor.swift       rule-builder panel (web panel 6): header, draft/error banners,
                                     identity, targeting, condition.
  AlertStudioPage.EditorValue.swift  severity + allowed-operators panel (web panel 7) + typed-value
                                     operand incl. any-change panel (web panel 1) + reusable chrome.
  AlertStudioPage.EditorSections.swift cooldown + alert-behaviour (recommend banner + force-choose) +
                                     max-fires + escalation + message editor + test target + actions.
  AlertStudioPage.EditorPickers.swift vehicle multi-select + inline computed-metric editor.
  AlertStudioPage.Snooze.swift       the snooze sheet (web snooze Modal): 1h/4h/24h + cancel-snooze.
  AlertStudioPage.Registration.swift navigation registration (composed in TeslaSyncApp) + demo fixtures.
  AlertStudioPage.Previews.swift     #Preview gallery: data/empty/error/loading/stale + Dynamic Type.
  AlertStudioPage.Tests.swift        24 XCTest cases (projection + model), XCTest-gated.
  AlertStudioPage.strings            P1/S10 catalog (table "AlertStudioPage") — 125 parity keys verbatim.

